                                                "sense_id": "2f9e2efd-97e1-30d1-9306-132dd3c15a4c",
                                                "text": "The BRB has ordered from Plasser & Theurer, through Plasser Railway Machinery (GB) Ltd., a total of 27 Plassermatic VKR-05-E hydraulic track levelling and tamping machines with electronic-beam levelling units."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "437f21bc-0084-433f-83a1-c360af6ae1fb",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9e2efd-97e1-30d1-9306-132dd3c15a4c",
                                                "text": "A near-miss between a tamping machine and a passenger train at Balham Junction on April 20 2019 was caused by a lack of information, lack of querying instructions and poor safety-critical communications."
